// The optional-param arity gate (http arc H4/H5): `headers` is the last accepted argument, so a
// third positional argument to a bodyless verb is a static arity error — proving the registry's
// optional-param support bounds the max arity, not just the min.
// expect: error E0007 at 6:6
use std.{http}
echo http.get("https://svc.test/echo", {"a": "b"}, "extra").status()
